{"id":15715368401,"name":"SIREN HEAD: LEGACY","desc":"Siren Head is a 40-foot-tall humanoid creature with a heavily emaciated, near-skeletal frame covered in dried, mummified flesh the color of rusty metal. We have located its position to be on an island with no population. Containment of the island has been succesful and project \"DISTRACTION\" has been approved. We will begin populating the island with prisoners and futher studies on the creature will be conducted.\n\n- All characters creatively belong to \"Trever Henderson\".\n- Voice lines are from \"David Near\".\n","path":"/game/15715368401-siren-head-legacy","slug":"15715368401-siren-head-legacy","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-94209d3b282aac1d7b528d63fb470955/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-382de38de76a30089a6a0df8aeccb25b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":268137448,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-17T12:23:38.383Z","creator":{"name":"Middleway Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"SIREN-HEAD:-LEGACY-WallLock-224230","_id":"6a82fd4ad8feb336b979f323","title":"WallLock","game":{"_id":"6892da33c23f749e70391e93","gameId":15715368401,"name":"SIREN HEAD: LEGACY","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-382de38de76a30089a6a0df8aeccb25b-8b3479553b1d.png","placeId":15715368401},"features":"Automatically detects the player closest to your cursor and surrounds them with walls to restrict their movement.","tags":[],"script":"-- Toggle U key\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal UserInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\nlocal Camera = workspace.CurrentCamera\nlocal LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal BuildEvent = game.ReplicatedStorage.remotes.build\n\nlocal Enabled = false\n\nUserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(Input, GameProcessed)\n\tif GameProcessed then return end\n\n\tif Input.KeyCode == Enum.KeyCode.U then\n\t\tEnabled = not Enabled\n\tend\nend)\n\nwhile task.wait() do\n\tif Enabled then\n\t\tlocal MousePosition = UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()\n\t\tlocal ClosestPlayer = nil\n\t\tlocal ClosestDistance = math.huge\n\n\t\tfor _, Player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n\t\t\tif Player ~= LocalPlayer then\n\t\t\t\tlocal Character = Player.Character\n\t\t\t\tlocal RootPart = Character and Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n\t\t\t\tif RootPart then\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal ScreenPosition, OnScreen = Camera:WorldToViewportPoint(RootPart.Position)\n\n\t\t\t\t\tif OnScreen then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlocal Distance = (Vector2.new(ScreenPosition.X, ScreenPosition.Y) - MousePosition).Magnitude\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif Distance < ClosestDistance then\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClosestDistance = Distance\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClosestPlayer = Player\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tif ClosestPlayer then\n\t\t\tlocal Character = ClosestPlayer.Character\n\t\t\tlocal RootPart = Character and Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n\t\t\tif RootPart then\n\t\t\t\tlocal HeightOffset = Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\") and 0.5 or -0.5\n\n\t\t\t\tBuildEvent:FireServer(\"Wall\",RootPart.CFrame*CFrame.new(0,HeightOffset,0)*CFrame.new(0,0,0,-4.3711388286738e-08,1,0,4.3711388286738e-08,1.9106854651647e-15,-1,-1,-4.3711388286738e-08,-4.3711388286738e-08))\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend","owner":{"_id":"69194b03b74d0b541cbd1642","username":"sasadsds","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69194b03b74d0b541cbd1642","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":545,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-382de38de76a30089a6a0df8aeccb25b-8b3479553b1d.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-08-17T12:23:38.385Z","editBy":{"_id":"69194b03b74d0b541cbd1642","username":"sasadsds","status":"offline","